<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Valety | Engineering Audit AI</title>
    <style>
        /* Base Styles */
        body { background-color: #0f172a; color: #cbd5e1; font-family: sans-serif; margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; }
        .container { max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
        
        /* Professional Gradient Header */
        h1 { font-size: 3rem; color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 10px; letter-spacing: -1px; }
        .highlight { color: #3b82f6; }
        
        /* Modern "Glass" Cards */
        .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 40px; }
        .card { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); padding: 30px; border-radius: 15px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); text-align: left; }
        .card h3 { color: #fff; margin-top: 0; }

        /* Buttons */
        .btn-primary { background: #2563eb; color: white; padding: 15px 30px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block; margin: 10px; }
        .btn-secondary { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); color: white; padding: 15px 30px; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; display: inline-block; margin: 10px; }
        
        /* Engineering Focus Section */
        .audit-info { margin-top: 50px; border-top: 1px solid #1e293b; padding-top: 30px; opacity: 0.8; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <header style="padding: 60px 0;">
            <div style="text-transform: uppercase; color: #60a5fa; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px; margin-bottom: 20px;">Enterprise Engineering AI</div>
            <h1>Stop <span class="highlight">Scope-Bleed</span> Before It Starts.</h1>
            <p style="font-size: 1.2rem; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;">
                Valety is a standalone Windows service that uses RAG-based AI to validate engineering proposals against RFPs and international standards[cite: 3, 4].
            </p>
            
            <div style="margin-top: 30px;">
                <a href="VALETY_INSTALLER.exe" class="btn-primary">Download Service (.exe)</a>
                <a href="https://t.me/your_bot_link" class="btn-secondary">Try on Telegram (Zero-UI)</a>
            </div>
        </header>

        <div class="grid">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Zero-UI Workflow</h3>
                <p>No training required. Simply Telegram a document to get an instant, professional audit report[cite: 12].</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Local & Secure</h3>
                <p>Standalone Windows service ensures data stays within your firm’s private infrastructure[cite: 80].</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Full Traceability</h3>
                <p>Every finding cites the exact file, page, and excerpt for 100% audit accuracy[cite: 11, 68].</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="audit-info">
            <p>Built for Engineering Consultants | Developed by <b>Amr Elfar</b> [cite: 1]</p>
            <p>Interested in our <b>20% Referral Broker Program</b>? Contact amr.elfar@bravo-ds.com</p>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
